// =========================================================
// STEP 13F - MULTI-PACK GLOBAL AGGREGATOR FOUNDATION
//
// Free Multi-Pack feature.
// Consumes the validated per-pack aggregates produced by Step 13E
// and computes one installation-level aggregate.
