// =========================================================
// STEP 13I-A - HA HEALTH COMPACT BRIDGE (MULTI-PACK)
//
// Purpose:
// - keep the complete health JSON on the historical MQTT topic;
// - publish a much smaller HA-facing health snapshot;
// - normal cadence: 5 minutes;
// - immediate publish on meaningful health/topology change;
// - reduce Home Assistant Recorder state_attributes growth.
